5,1,1,talk,Mio,,We really need to stop guessing the fees! Let's look at the actual data so we know exactly what we need to cover for next year.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It would be wise to understand why some members seem hesitant lately before we lock in a new structure.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,It's not just about the money. I want to see who is actually showing up and who is just coasting on the others.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should also consider the administrative side. The treasurer's role is a heavy burden that we cannot ignore.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Let's just make sure we don't make it too scary for new people to join. We need to keep it welcoming!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, that's a good point. If we pick a complex system, the treasurer will quit again. Let's divide the research.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I'll look into the attendance patterns. I want to see if there's a correlation between the fees and the turnout.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'll handle the usage stats. I want to see the gap between the regulars and the ghosts.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will investigate the workload and the financial records to see where the time and money actually go.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll check out the people who didn't join and the mid-year sign-ups to see what stops them.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll take the ledger and the bank statements. I need to know our fixed costs and how people actually pay.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'll add the winter social notes to my list to see what the quieter members are thinking.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll check the sign-in sheets and the rota. I want to see who is doing the heavy lifting.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I'll look at the treasurer's logged hours and the minute books from the named-grade years.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll look at the taster evening forms and the mid-year joiner records.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
